### star-plan-executor/SKILL.md
--- 1
The active executor retains responsibility for the user's execution goal. Before a heavy launch or merge, use the Skill tool to run `star-code-reviewer` for this leaf unless a recorded review already covers the current code version and scope and satisfies the existing launch guard when a launch is pending. Pass the existing execution goal and authority, and require the reviewer to return its evidence and control here. A standalone review-only request has no continuation.
+++ 1
The active executor retains responsibility for the user's execution goal. Before a heavy launch or merge, run `star-code-reviewer` for this leaf through this host's skill invocation unless a recorded review already covers the current code version and scope and satisfies the existing launch guard when a launch is pending. Pass the existing execution goal and authority, and require the reviewer to return its evidence and control here. A standalone review-only request has no continuation.
### star-plan-executor/references/agent_dispatch_spec.md
--- 1
Delegate whenever collaboration tools are available and the work is bounded, independent, and materially benefits from a separate context or parallel execution. When delegating, dispatch a writing sub-agent on the EXEC tier's model (conventions §10.8), where the harness can name one; use a read-only sub-agent, on the READ tier's model, only for a read-only orientation scope. With a tier's key empty the dispatch names no model at all. Execute locally when a step is small, sequential, tightly coupled to current edits, or likely to cause overlapping file ownership. Do not create one subagent per trivial action.
+++ 1
Delegate whenever collaboration tools are available and the work is bounded, independent, and materially benefits from a separate context or parallel execution. When delegating, dispatch a writing sub-agent on the EXEC tier's model — or the pool alias binding its configured depth — (conventions §10.8), where the harness can name one; use a read-only sub-agent, on the READ tier's model or its depth binding, only for a read-only orientation scope. With a tier's key empty the dispatch names no model at all. Execute locally when a step is small, sequential, tightly coupled to current edits, or likely to cause overlapping file ownership. Do not create one subagent per trivial action.
### star-plan-executor/references/agent_dispatch_spec_zh.md
--- 1
仅当协作工具可用，且工作边界明确、相互独立、确实能从独立上下文或并行执行中获益时才委派。委派时调用你的子代理工具，实现工作使用可写子代理、跑在 EXEC 档的模型上（规约 §10.8，前提是这个宿主能指定受托者用哪个模型）；只有只读勘察范围使用只读子代理，跑在 READ 档的模型上。哪一档的键为空，那一档的派发就不指定模型。步骤很小、严格串行、与当前改动紧耦合或容易产生文件冲突时，由主 agent 本地完成。不要给每个琐碎动作都创建一个 subagent。
+++ 1
仅当协作工具可用，且工作边界明确、相互独立、确实能从独立上下文或并行执行中获益时才委派。委派时调用你的子代理工具，实现工作使用可写子代理、跑在 EXEC 档的模型——或绑定其配置深度的池别名——上（规约 §10.8，前提是这个宿主能指定受托者用哪个模型）；只有只读勘察范围使用只读子代理，跑在 READ 档的模型或其深度绑定上。哪一档的键为空，那一档的派发就不指定模型。步骤很小、严格串行、与当前改动紧耦合或容易产生文件冲突时，由主 agent 本地完成。不要给每个琐碎动作都创建一个 subagent。
